 R←Test_UC_NuGet_003(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempFolder;parms;I;rc;msg;debug
⍝ Open project, add 2 NuGet packages to non-default folder, load, call, list, close, re-open, close
⍝ *** WARNING: want to rename this fn? Keep in mind to rename the "∆"-prefixed twin as well:
⍝ ***          the process started here runs the function called "∆",(this function's name).
 ⍝ The real test function (∆Test_UC_NuGet_003) is executed in its own APL process
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If ~∆DotNetIsAvailable
     R←T._NotApplicable ⋄ →0
 :EndIf

 tempFolder←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 debug←0
 parms←debug ∆NuGetTestProcessParms(⊃⎕SI)tempFolder
 I←APLProcess.New parms
 →T.GoToTidyUp I.ExitCode≠130
 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempFolder
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
